{"ref":"BDB, תָּאַם","hw":"תָּאַם","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">תָּאַם</span>]</big>  <strong>vb. denom. be double</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pt. pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תֹּאֲמִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:24\" href=\"/Exodus.26.24\">Ex 26:24</a> ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תּוֹאֲמִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:29\" href=\"/Exodus.36.29\">36:29</a>; so read also (for <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּמִּים</span>) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:24\" href=\"/Exodus.26.24\">26:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:29\" href=\"/Exodus.36.29\">36:29</a> (both P), cf. Sam. Di Baen ARSK<sup>Hast. DB iv.661</sup>.<br><strong>Hiph.</strong>  <em>bear twins:</em> Pt. f. pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַתְאִימוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 4:2\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.4.2\">Ct 5:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 6:6\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.6.6\">6:6</a>.","next":"BDB, תַּאֲנָה²","prev":"BDB, תּוֹאָם"}